of planning a journey.

00:17:03.650 --> 00:17:07.280
We have a solution for this
in our Smart Park system.

00:17:07.280 --> 00:17:11.230
The beauty of Smart Park lies
in its simplicity and agility,

00:17:11.230 --> 00:17:13.349
allowing us to
configure each site

00:17:13.349 --> 00:17:15.460
to any sets of requirements.

00:17:15.460 --> 00:17:18.640
First, we survey and assess
which of our technologies

00:17:18.640 --> 00:17:21.880
is most suitable to
record vehicle activity.

00:17:21.880 --> 00:17:24.910
This could be both automatic
